        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Giovanni Ribisi, Alison Wright, Anne Hathaway, Tony Hale, Michael Stahl-David, Zach Booth, Poorna Jagannathan\n- Works: Sneaky Pete, The Americans\n- Organizations: The Barrow Group\n- Roles: Marius Josipovic, Pete Murphy, Martha Hanson, Marjorie\n\nFacts:\n- Giovanni Ribisi was born on December 17, 1974, and he is an American film and television actor.\n- Alison Wright was born on July 12, 1976, and she is an English actress.\n- In Sneaky Pete, Giovanni Ribisi plays Marius Josipovic, a released convict who adopts the identity of his cell mate Pete Murphy to avoid his past life.\n- Alison Wright is best known for playing Martha Hanson on The Americans and Marjorie on Sneaky Pete.\n- The Barrow Group counts Anne Hathaway, Tony Hale, Alison Wright, Michael Stahl-David, Zach Booth, and Poorna Jagannathan among its alumni.",
